title: Rally the Delegation
subtitle: Gather signatures and courage for the stand against the Chancellor.
is-card: true
tags: last_days
card-image: img/card_senate.svg
view-if: finale and not ld_delegation_used_today
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; ld_delegation_used_today = 1; last_card_timer = ""
new-page: true

= Rally the Delegation

Senators who once applauded the Chancellor now meet in shadowed offices. Every signature is a risk.

- @do: Rally the Delegation.
- @easy_discard

@do
on-arrival: petition_signatures += 4 + rc_r / 4; senate_resolve += 1; mod_relation += 3; ind_relation += 3

Bail Organa and Mon Mothma go from office to office through the night. By dawn, dozens more senators have added their names.
